flowchart TD
    A[Create Repair Order] --> B[Add Service Lines]
    B --> C[Generate Order Operations]
    C --> D[Execute Operations]
    D --> E{All Operations Done?}
    E -- No --> D
    E -- Yes --> F[Mark Order Ready]
    F --> G[Create Delivery Document]
    G --> H[Confirm Delivery]
    H --> I[Order Becomes Delivered]
    I --> J[Create Billing Batch]
    J --> K[Load Delivered Orders By Period]
    K --> L[Confirm Billing Batch]
    L --> M[Create Invoice]
    M --> N[Open / Validate Invoice]
